     <p><strong><p>Rex Welshon, <em>Nietzsche’s On the Genealogy of Morality: A Guide</em>, Oxford University Press, 2023, 296pp., $30.99 (pbk) ISBN 9780197611821.</p></strong></p>
     <p><strong>Reviewed by Guy Elgat, School of the Art Institute of Chicago</strong></p>
